            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Cloud Media Shrinker 1.2.3</h2>
<ul>
<li>The Mac download now keeps itself up to date. It checks once a day. You can check any time, or switch automatic checks off, in the Cloud Media Shrinker menu.</li>
<li>An update never stops a queue. If you install one while something is being compressed or deleted, the app restarts to finish updating once the queue is done.</li>
<li>Your license, settings and history stay as they are.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
